# Rendered PDFs are large and fully regenerable from urls.txt — keep the
# page-1 PNG previews (small, useful as a visual record) but not these.
out/*.pdf
# The binary `go build ./cmd/corpus` leaves here. Anchored: a bare `corpus`
# also matched cmd/corpus/ and silently kept glued.go out of #24.
/corpus
out/**/*.pdf
out/judges/
.judges-node/
